 "notes": ["gen-round.md lists 85 promoted names; promote.log has 89 distinct models: 88 new to the catalog plus jungle vine, which round 3 regenerated over the P45G model of the same id. The four the table misses (basalt column rock r8, exposed tree root r14 – regenerated in r18, so promotedPerRound counts it twice –, cattail reed r18, river boulder r23) came from list nouns in the plural (basalt column rocks, exposed tree roots, cattail reeds, river boulders).","droppedByManifest: promoted, then removed because the hero-manifest generator would have taken them (src/play/assets/__tests__/catalog-entries.test.ts pins that file).","City has no vegetation layer (a look with flora thins its landmark row to one prop every 24 m, which would empty the street of houses) and no generic city kit (a kit takes every other slot of the look, and the race starts each road segment with the kit’s first prop: the cc0 townhouse gave way to a wall of rough glass towers). Street tree, buildings and street props go to the downtown, park, parking lot and construction site kits instead.","Generic kits for forest, jungle, desert, beach and snow replace the even slots of the look’s props. Treehouse, jungle ruin and igloo are kit members (source p46g-keep in kit-nouns.json), so they stay; in sentences that name only the setting the desert loses the camel, the beach the rowing boat and surfboard, the snow the ice block and iceberg.","A look carries at most FLORA_SPECIES = 14 species (one InstancedMesh, i.e. one draw call, per species)."]
